{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1130379-fedex-and-character-sheets","id":1130379,"title":"Fedex and character sheets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-17T11:44:45-07:00","id":1130379,"title":"Fedex and character sheets","content":"I printed up some character sheets for an upcoming Exalted campaign that a friend is running. I don't currently have a printer, so I instead opted to use Fedex. I got a stern warning to never use their services again for character sheets as it's &quot;trademarked&quot;. Has anyone else had similar problems such as these at places like Fedex or other places that offer printing services?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13933-the-running-halfling","name":"The Running Halfling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T12:22:39-07:00","id":1130400,"title":"","content":"I have no idea how it actually applies to copyright law or liability, but often character sheets are expressly permitted to be printed in their associated books, at least in White Wolf stuff. Not that FedEx would know that... I guess if they can make even the barest apprehension that you might be selling them, they'll nix it. It's also possible (likely) that whoever made that call had no idea and was just covering their ass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T12:44:57-07:00","id":1130416,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure the employee just didn't know and was covering their bases. They'll print from a thumb drive, right? You could use Mr. Gone's sheets. They're technically fan-made and as far as I know, not copyrighted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T13:40:36-07:00","id":1130445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1130379-fedex-and-character-sheets?p=1130416#post1130416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm pretty sure the employee just didn't know and was covering their bases. They'll print from a thumb drive, right? You could use Mr. Gone's sheets. They're technically fan-made and as far as I know, not copyrighted.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It was a Mr. Gone's sheet that I was using actually. They said that if I wanted to print the sheet again, that I would have to edit out the Exalted logo in the upper left corner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13933-the-running-halfling","name":"The Running Halfling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T18:23:07-07:00","id":1130632,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that was an employee not knowing what a character sheet is or how they're used and reacting to the fact that there was a logo on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T03:58:38-07:00","id":1130763,"title":"","content":"To be fair, he did (kind of) know what a character sheet was, even though he called it a &quot;Dungeons and Dragons sheet&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13933-the-running-halfling","name":"The Running Halfling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13933_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T11:00:46-07:00","id":1130892,"title":"","content":"Weird.. Sorry you had trouble with them not wanting to print one of my sheets. Not sure it'll help, but I put a statement on my web site giving permission for them to be printed.<br /> <br /> I suppose I could start putting a statement on the sheets themselves, that'd be a bit of work though. lol.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}